                ],
                [
                    139.0,
                    1095.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 10. In the event of a change in shift, employees must be off work for a minimum of three shifts or their equivalent unless a scheduled day or days off intervene between such shift change. Employees shall not be required to work more than two different shifts in a work week, except for emergencies. Exceptions to this Section may be made upon mutual agreement between the Employer and the employee.",
